No license is granted to source titles/abstracts/author lists, raw provider records, source-text ledgers, model weights/cards, embeddings/arrays, full masked-score vectors, third-party packages/software, publisher templates/fonts, licensed literature, private reports/correspondence, original private history or manuscripts. Referenced dependency versions, model revisions, identifiers and hashes do not relicense external material. Read THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/data_rights.md.

